    {
      "heading": "Model identity and source scope",
      "source_text": "ViewFinity S9 27-inch\nSource page identifies: ViewFinity S9\nModel/SKU: LS27C902PAMXUE",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Specifications",
      "source_text": "- Resolution: 5,120 x 2,880\n- Aspect Ratio: 16:9\n- Brightness (Typical): 600 cd/㎡\n- Contrast Ratio Static: 1000:1\n- Response Time: 5ms(GTG)\n- Refresh Rate: Max 60Hz\n- Viewing Angle (H/V): 178°(H)/178°(V)",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Display",
      "source_text": "- Screen Size (Class): 27\n- Flat / Curved: Flat\n- Active Display Size (HxV) (mm): 596.736 x 335.664 mm\n- Aspect Ratio: 16:9\n- Panel Type: IPS\n- Brightness (Typical): 600 cd/㎡\n- Brightness (Min): 480 cd/㎡\n- Contrast Ratio Static: 1000:1\n- HDR(High Dynamic Range): Yes\n- Resolution: 5,120 x 2,880\n- Response Time: 5ms(GTG)\n- Viewing Angle (H/V): 178°(H)/178°(V)\n- Color Support: Max 1B\n- Color Gamut (DCI Coverage): 99% (Typ)\n- sRGB Coverage: 100% (Typ.)\n- Refresh Rate: Max 60Hz",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "General Feature",
      "source_text": "- Eye Saver Mode: Yes\n- Flicker Free: Yes\n- Game Mode: Yes\n- Image Size: Yes\n- Windows Certification: Windows 10\n- Virtual AIM Point: Yes\n- Game Bar 2.0: Yes\n- Auto Source Switch: Auto Source Switch+\n- Adaptive Picture: Yes\n- Ultrawide Game View: Yes",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Smart Service",
      "source_text": "- Smart Type: Smart\n- Operating System: Tizen™\n- Bixby: US English, UK English, India English, Korean, French, German, Italian, Spanish, BR Portuguese, Turkish(Turkiye only) (features vary by language)\n- Far-Field Voice Interaction: Yes\n- Video Communication: Google Meet\n- Web Service: Microsoft 365\n- SmartThings Hub: Yes\n- Multi Device Experience: Mobile to Screen, Screen initiate mirroring, Screen Sound to Mobile, Sound Mirroring, Wireless On\n- Wireless DeX: Yes\n- My Contents: Yes\n- Multi View: upto 2 videos\n- Smart Calibration: Basic/Professional for Pro Monitor\n- NFT: Nifty Gateway\n- Tap View: Yes\n- Remote Access: Yes",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
      "source_file": "sources/samsung/displays/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-source.md"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Interface",
      "source_text": "- Wireless Display: Yes\n- Mini-Display Port: 1 EA\n- HDCP Version (Mini-DP): 2.2\n- USB Hub: 3\n- USB Hub Version: 3\n- Thunderbolt 3: 1 EA\n- Thunderbolt 3 Charging Power (Port 1): 90W\n- Version of Thunderbolt: 4.0\n- HDCP Version (Thunderbolt): 2.2\n- Wireless LAN Built-in: Yes (WiFi5)\n- Bluetooth: Yes (BT4.2)",
      "source_url": "https://www.samsung.com/sa_en/monitors/high-resolution/viewfinity-s9-27-inch-5k-resolution-ls27c902pamxue/",
